    "name": "Bolt Bot Screwy Viruses",
    "steam_appid": 2050380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/24a2b5b7388d9cb717a6d19644183143.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/14ea0fb8c0964856fedb59488c4cea00.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/14ea0fb8c0964856fedb59488c4cea00.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/14ea0fb8c0964856fedb59488c4cea00.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/0c90e9aa0d1d5877a93b66e94e934313.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/0c90e9aa0d1d5877a93b66e94e934313.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/0c90e9aa0d1d5877a93b66e94e934313.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CLASSIC PLATFORMING FUN!</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a robot named Bolt in 48 levels of 3D platforming fun Inspired by the golden age of platform games. It is a collect-a-thon at heart and rewards the player constantly in a vibrant and evolving hub world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/dd49611c5cf3d70c1b77a1c187794dbf.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/dd49611c5cf3d70c1b77a1c187794dbf.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/dd49611c5cf3d70c1b77a1c187794dbf.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/ba99c7c9d30c919c856781942d0ce2ed.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/ba99c7c9d30c919c856781942d0ce2ed.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/ba99c7c9d30c919c856781942d0ce2ed.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two shops are fighting for customers on the same street. One is called Bolt's Bit's and Bot's and the other is Mr Coin's Treasure Cove. When the evil Mr Coin realizes Bolt's shop is doing more business than his, he releases a virus which infects all of Bolt's products. Bolt then has to enter each one of his toy like models and repair everything inside to increase his store rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/377db0a2b41349b6c534fc68e401a313.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/377db0a2b41349b6c534fc68e401a313.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/377db0a2b41349b6c534fc68e401a313.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5f53fc589b8e7621e2eb6e32558a65f9.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5f53fc589b8e7621e2eb6e32558a65f9.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5f53fc589b8e7621e2eb6e32558a65f9.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>TOOLS AND UPGRADES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bolt is both a skilled mechanic and inventive genius, so he has many different tools and contraptions at his disposal, such as a spanner to fix things with and a whip to reach higher locations. His trusty sky wing also makes an appearance, so that he can safely glide around in style!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/55d5b730e7011f4121bb84778b69c7a9.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/55d5b730e7011f4121bb84778b69c7a9.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/55d5b730e7011f4121bb84778b69c7a9.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e5d8e7090b103055735e2bd22d45a285.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e5d8e7090b103055735e2bd22d45a285.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e5d8e7090b103055735e2bd22d45a285.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>BIT'S AND BOT'S</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main hub world in the game is called Bit's and Bot's. Every collectible found in each level of the game is tied to it. The more you collect, the more the shop becomes alive and joyful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<u>Scrap</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/611d33d7be7ffdd3925a6b3175e42e3d.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div><u><strong> </strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scrap can be traded with Mr Coin for an extra Microchip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u><strong>Microchips</strong></u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c3925d5378e1017853ed04319a1423d9.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Microchips are the main beating heart of the shop. They power up various display stands, unlock catchy music tracks, new paint schemes to customize Bolt with and they also unlock bonus levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u>Coins</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/3054ace60e51ac9204ca27d4fcd7a689.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coins can be used to hire Mr Coins staff members for your own shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u>Viruses</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/83b30746580d2a6a17608de26ee5dfa0.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viruses have infected Bolt's products and need to be removed. Removing every single one from a product will reward you with a shiny collectible card, which can be displayed and viewed from one of the stores many card holder stands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a total of 48 cards to collect!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e0ea4dd5ec1e3e3ed9d6897e9828b275.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/70cfab01db65391160d9865ac68e1832.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/70cfab01db65391160d9865ac68e1832.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/70cfab01db65391160d9865ac68e1832.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c83fe7aabeb013125d61108f3fc2dc7d.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c83fe7aabeb013125d61108f3fc2dc7d.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c83fe7aabeb013125d61108f3fc2dc7d.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>BONUS LEVELS!\u00a0</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No waiting around for bonus levels to unlock! Collecting all the scrap in only two levels rewards you with a brand new and unique challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One bonus level has Bolt jumping through a massive tv screen and trying to stop the tv channels from counting down and in another he is chased by one of Mr Coins minions in a vehicle modded with deadly saw blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Platformer completionists will be surprised and delighted each time during their 15 - 20 hour playthrough!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5b58ba3a4ab7713175d0f4bddbfa5dea.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5b58ba3a4ab7713175d0f4bddbfa5dea.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5b58ba3a4ab7713175d0f4bddbfa5dea.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/f77829b47e83a6ab050e4d08561ad6d5.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/f77829b47e83a6ab050e4d08561ad6d5.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/f77829b47e83a6ab050e4d08561ad6d5.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Controller Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable with a Mouse and Keyboard or with the Xbox Controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Dualshock Controllers and Third Party Controllers are not supported yet) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5abf2097c66e304a4c1be8453ef39fa9.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5abf2097c66e304a4c1be8453ef39fa9.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5abf2097c66e304a4c1be8453ef39fa9.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>STEAM DECK COMPATIBILITY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>100% Playable!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After clicking start with the touch screen or touch-pad Bolt Bot is fully playable from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Cloud Saves </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfortunately, cloud saves are not possible. The game started development without steam deck in mind, so please choose either the PC or Steam Deck for your playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/53f03b7f561f59d7f5b90bc710ed2581.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/da885851e60d12106985a925bd7ecd76.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/da885851e60d12106985a925bd7ecd76.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/da885851e60d12106985a925bd7ecd76.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/53f03b7f561f59d7f5b90bc710ed2581.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/24a2b5b7388d9cb717a6d19644183143.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/14ea0fb8c0964856fedb59488c4cea00.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/14ea0fb8c0964856fedb59488c4cea00.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/14ea0fb8c0964856fedb59488c4cea00.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/0c90e9aa0d1d5877a93b66e94e934313.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/0c90e9aa0d1d5877a93b66e94e934313.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/0c90e9aa0d1d5877a93b66e94e934313.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CLASSIC PLATFORMING FUN!</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a robot named Bolt in 48 levels of 3D platforming fun Inspired by the golden age of platform games. It is a collect-a-thon at heart and rewards the player constantly in a vibrant and evolving hub world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/dd49611c5cf3d70c1b77a1c187794dbf.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/dd49611c5cf3d70c1b77a1c187794dbf.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/dd49611c5cf3d70c1b77a1c187794dbf.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/ba99c7c9d30c919c856781942d0ce2ed.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/ba99c7c9d30c919c856781942d0ce2ed.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/ba99c7c9d30c919c856781942d0ce2ed.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two shops are fighting for customers on the same street. One is called Bolt's Bit's and Bot's and the other is Mr Coin's Treasure Cove. When the evil Mr Coin realizes Bolt's shop is doing more business than his, he releases a virus which infects all of Bolt's products. Bolt then has to enter each one of his toy like models and repair everything inside to increase his store rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/377db0a2b41349b6c534fc68e401a313.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/377db0a2b41349b6c534fc68e401a313.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/377db0a2b41349b6c534fc68e401a313.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5f53fc589b8e7621e2eb6e32558a65f9.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5f53fc589b8e7621e2eb6e32558a65f9.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5f53fc589b8e7621e2eb6e32558a65f9.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>TOOLS AND UPGRADES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bolt is both a skilled mechanic and inventive genius, so he has many different tools and contraptions at his disposal, such as a spanner to fix things with and a whip to reach higher locations. His trusty sky wing also makes an appearance, so that he can safely glide around in style!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/55d5b730e7011f4121bb84778b69c7a9.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/55d5b730e7011f4121bb84778b69c7a9.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/55d5b730e7011f4121bb84778b69c7a9.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e5d8e7090b103055735e2bd22d45a285.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e5d8e7090b103055735e2bd22d45a285.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e5d8e7090b103055735e2bd22d45a285.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>BIT'S AND BOT'S</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main hub world in the game is called Bit's and Bot's. Every collectible found in each level of the game is tied to it. The more you collect, the more the shop becomes alive and joyful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<u>Scrap</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/611d33d7be7ffdd3925a6b3175e42e3d.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div><u><strong> </strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scrap can be traded with Mr Coin for an extra Microchip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u><strong>Microchips</strong></u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c3925d5378e1017853ed04319a1423d9.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Microchips are the main beating heart of the shop. They power up various display stands, unlock catchy music tracks, new paint schemes to customize Bolt with and they also unlock bonus levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u>Coins</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/3054ace60e51ac9204ca27d4fcd7a689.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coins can be used to hire Mr Coins staff members for your own shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u>Viruses</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/83b30746580d2a6a17608de26ee5dfa0.avif?t=1752821252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viruses have infected Bolt's products and need to be removed. Removing every single one from a product will reward you with a shiny collectible card, which can be displayed and viewed from one of the stores many card holder stands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a total of 48 cards to collect!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/e0ea4dd5ec1e3e3ed9d6897e9828b275.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/70cfab01db65391160d9865ac68e1832.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/70cfab01db65391160d9865ac68e1832.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/70cfab01db65391160d9865ac68e1832.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c83fe7aabeb013125d61108f3fc2dc7d.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c83fe7aabeb013125d61108f3fc2dc7d.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/c83fe7aabeb013125d61108f3fc2dc7d.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>BONUS LEVELS!\u00a0</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No waiting around for bonus levels to unlock! Collecting all the scrap in only two levels rewards you with a brand new and unique challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One bonus level has Bolt jumping through a massive tv screen and trying to stop the tv channels from counting down and in another he is chased by one of Mr Coins minions in a vehicle modded with deadly saw blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Platformer completionists will be surprised and delighted each time during their 15 - 20 hour playthrough!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5b58ba3a4ab7713175d0f4bddbfa5dea.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5b58ba3a4ab7713175d0f4bddbfa5dea.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5b58ba3a4ab7713175d0f4bddbfa5dea.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/f77829b47e83a6ab050e4d08561ad6d5.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/f77829b47e83a6ab050e4d08561ad6d5.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/f77829b47e83a6ab050e4d08561ad6d5.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Controller Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable with a Mouse and Keyboard or with the Xbox Controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Dualshock Controllers and Third Party Controllers are not supported yet) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5abf2097c66e304a4c1be8453ef39fa9.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5abf2097c66e304a4c1be8453ef39fa9.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/5abf2097c66e304a4c1be8453ef39fa9.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>STEAM DECK COMPATIBILITY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>100% Playable!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After clicking start with the touch screen or touch-pad Bolt Bot is fully playable from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Cloud Saves </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfortunately, cloud saves are not possible. The game started development without steam deck in mind, so please choose either the PC or Steam Deck for your playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/53f03b7f561f59d7f5b90bc710ed2581.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/da885851e60d12106985a925bd7ecd76.poster.avif?t=1752821252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/da885851e60d12106985a925bd7ecd76.webm?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/da885851e60d12106985a925bd7ecd76.mp4?t=1752821252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050380/extras/53f03b7f561f59d7f5b90bc710ed2581.avif?t=1752821252\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
